{"unit_id": "tag:02W3:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>覆盖（covering），其覆盖<MATH_0004>。设<MATH_0005>为相对于<MATH_0006>的下降（descent）数据（datum），并假设每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>具有性质<MATH_0008>。须证明存在概形（scheme）<MATH_0009>，使<MATH_0010>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n在正式开始证明前，指出对于任意态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0011>以及族（families）的任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，若将下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0013>拉回（pullback）为下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0014>，其底为<MATH_0015>，则每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0016>也具有性质<MATH_0017>。这是因为假设(1)说<MATH_0018>在任意基变换（base change）下稳定，再结合拉回（pullback）的定义（见定义<REF_0001>）。以下使用此事实时不再提及。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n首先在<MATH_0019>仿射（affine）时证明此引理。由拓扑（Topologies）引理<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>或<REF_0006>，存在标准（standard）<MATH_0020>覆盖（covering）<MATH_0021>，它加细（refines）<MATH_0022>。拉回（pullback）函子（functor）<MATH_0023>作用于下降（descent）数据（data）的范畴（categories）之间，由引理<REF_0007>它完全忠实（fully faithful）。因此只需证明相对于标准（standard）<MATH_0024>覆盖（covering）<MATH_0025>的下降（descent）数据（datum）有效（effective）。由假设(2)，<MATH_0026>具有性质<MATH_0027>。由引理<REF_0008>，可归约到覆盖（covering）<MATH_0028>，而引理的假设(3)已假定此情形的结论。因此当<MATH_0029>仿射（affine）时引理成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n假设<MATH_0030>为一般情形。令<MATH_0031>为仿射开集（affine open）。由景（site）的性质，族（family）<MATH_0032>为<MATH_0033>覆盖（covering），其覆盖<MATH_0034>。以<MATH_0035>表示给定下降（descent）数据（datum）在<MATH_0036>上的限制（restriction）（或拉回（pullback））。由刚才的结果，得到概形（scheme）<MATH_0037>，其底为<MATH_0038>，它相对于<MATH_0039>的典范（canonical）下降（descent）数据（datum）同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0040>。假设<MATH_0041>是<MATH_0042>的仿射开集（affine open）。则<MATH_0043>和<MATH_0044>均具有同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0045>的典范（canonical）下降（descent）数据（data）。因此再次由引理<REF_0009>，得到典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0046>，其底为<MATH_0047>，它将<MATH_0048>等同于<MATH_0049>在<MATH_0050>中的逆（inverse）像（image）。我们省略如下验证：给定仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0051>，它们包含在<MATH_0052>中，有<MATH_0053>。\n\n<STRUCT_0007><STRUCT_0008>\n由构造（Constructions）引理<REF_0010>，数据（data）<MATH_0054>粘合（glue）成概形（scheme）<MATH_0055>。此外，得到同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0056>，它们恢复映射（maps）<MATH_0057>。展开概形（schemes）<MATH_0058>的构造，得到同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0059>\n，它们与映射（maps）<MATH_0060>相容，并且与限制（restricting）到<MATH_0061>中较小的仿射开集（affine opens）相容。这蕴含<MATH_0062>上的典范（canonical）下降（descent）数据（datum）同构（isomorphic）于给定下降（descent）数据（datum），这就证明了结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "families", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refines", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "standard", "target_term": "标准"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": 